By now, you've got the basics of Romansh, so it's time for the fun bit! This unit basically all about expanding you're vocabulary, learning lots of new nouns, and venturing into the past tense with verbs. I've also decided to give you a little more freedom about what you're learning, and from here on the path is morphing from the waterfall layout into the tree layout. I'll see you at the end of the unit!